# prisma — F-26 (Phase 1B): corrected path. The generator's `output` in
# schema.prisma is `../src/generated/prisma`, not `prisma/generated` — the
# old path here never matched anything, so the generated client was never
# actually excluded.
packages/db/src/generated/

